803 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\034Bytes is your baby\041\035\nThis is what folks at Quicko used to tell me\056\n\nI played an integral part in the debelopment of this short and digestible newsletter\056 I worked with Yatrik\054 the UX designer\054 to set up the design language\056 In fact\054 at point\054 I was getting to learn so much about various design processes\056 We explore numerous\nbrands with unique design languages\056\n\nOnce we had the process set up and the site was ready to go\054 I took it up as my sole responsibilty to write\054 work on the designs\054 fix minor backend and frontend bugs\054 and so much more\056\n\nI also encouraged freshers and young interns at Quicko to work on Bytes to gain some knowledge qabout the financial world\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 804 0 R
     /Pg 799 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

