809 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This was a point of my life where I truly knew what I wanted to\ndo \055 it was design\041 But I was unsure how to go about it or where to begin\056 Design is such a vast area\056 Later\054 in 2021\054 I came across a disciple called Human Computer Interaction and it immediately piqued my interest\056 Since then I\031ve spent countless hours trying to learn about this subject and develop the necessary skills\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 810 0 R
     /Pg 799 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

